      given axis, ignoring NaNs.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.nansum`: Compute the sum of array elements along a given
      axis, ignoring NaNs.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.nanmean`: Compute the mean of array elements along a given
      axis, ignoring NaNs.

